Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社制作，仅用于日语交流使用\N请勿私自二次上传及用作商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}翻译:阿恁&雪音  校对:狗粮山  时轴:懒鬼后裔樰七  后期:冷面珺  压制:zoe  海报:狗粮山
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:10.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,圣诞节啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:13.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,想送点什么给冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:19.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,首饰么…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:24.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐她好像一直都戴耳饰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.49,0:00:26.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,谢谢惠顾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:31.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,买下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:35.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,希望冬月小姐喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:54.86,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1225.333,761.333)}第8话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:54.86,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1477.333,833.333)}妹妹登场！滑雪场过圣诞节
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.89,0:01:00.48,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}冷たい指先感じられる距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.89,0:01:00.48,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}能感受到指尖冰凉的距离感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:06.56,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}もどかしくて少し切ない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:06.56,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}令人急不可待  又有些许愁绪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:12.57,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}ひとつずつ灯る街灯に呼応して
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:12.57,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}与一盏盏点亮的路灯遥相呼应
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:18.42,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}募っていく気持ちに気付いた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:18.42,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}觉察到心中一点点积攒的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:26.07,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,照れ隠してもクールぶっても {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:26.07,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,不管是遮羞  抑或是装酷 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:28.96,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,見透かされそう {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:28.96,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,都像会被看透似的 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:32.12,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,やさしく {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:32.12,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,温柔地 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:34.37,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Freeze for a minute {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:34.37,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,冻结一分钟 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:37.38,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,心ごと {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:37.38,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,全心全意 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:43.50,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,I miss you 言わせたくて {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:43.50,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,想让你说  我想你 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:46.66,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Let me love you honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:46.66,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,让我爱你  honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:49.69,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,言えない for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:49.69,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,说不出口  for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.94,0:01:57.68,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,いつか言葉にできたら {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.94,0:01:57.68,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,假如有朝一日能说出口 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:28.75,Koori-picture4,,0,0,0,,{\frz288.1\pos(224,714)\fad(0,400)}青春由纯白开启——
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:27.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,憧憬已久的活动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:30.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:34.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,标语过于应景了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.49,0:02:40.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,天气真好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一片纯白啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:45.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冬月小姐一起滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:48.70,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,滑雪  滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.89,0:02:51.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天  四个人一起来滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.81,0:02:56.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是一周前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:03:04.78,Koori-picture6,,0,0,0,,中奖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:03:02.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  快看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:03.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,锵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我中奖了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:08.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎  一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:13.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可我没滑过雪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:15.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,邀请别人比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:18.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不要不要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:22.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,既然没有滑过更加要去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:26.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一定会有新发现啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,如果滑得开心  就是新发现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.46,0:03:35.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就算超级无聊  也是新发现啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:40.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,也是呢  那请务必算上我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:42.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.84,0:03:49.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:54.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生会滑雪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:57.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯  还行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:03:59.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:05.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那么  能请你教教冬月小姐滑雪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:12.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冬月小姐一起滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:15.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.89,0:04:21.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好嘞  机会难得  晚上大家一起开圣诞派对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,圣诞节…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:28.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,大家一起来一场滑雪旅行！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:40.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我想确认一下你的脚是不是固定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:43.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能稍微抬一下脚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.65,0:04:44.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:51.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:53.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:55.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和喜欢的人一起滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:59.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我从未想过在我的人生中会有这样的大事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.04,0:05:03.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的是  忍不住说起冷笑话来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:05.20,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,注：日语中「喜欢」与「滑雪」发音相近。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:05.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和喜欢的人一起滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:08.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个  冰室先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:10.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:14.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  给你添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:18.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没事  我很擅长滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.24,0:05:22.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那麻烦你教我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:25.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:30.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,首先从简单的地方教起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:31.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.32,0:05:35.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,先试试唰一下滑下去  然后啪一下停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.53,0:05:38.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,唰…啪？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.65,0:05:41.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我先示范给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:46.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就这样  唰一下滑下去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:51.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啪一下停住
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:57.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,很简单的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.95,0:05:59.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你先试试
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:11.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啪叽…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:18.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太可爱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:24.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个  抱歉  唰一下有点难以做到…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:28.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,糟糕了  以前我都是自然而然就会滑的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.46,0:06:30.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,压根不知道怎么教人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.23,0:06:34.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而且我听的教学是全用拟声词的关西腔导游中心说明啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:36.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这条路要是唰地下去得搁那儿砰地撞上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:38.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你得从这儿哔一下转过去才成
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.72,0:06:44.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抓住这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:46.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好  好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:49.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我把你拉起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:52.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.40,0:06:59.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,首先  想要稳住重心  维持前倾的姿势就好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:03.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,前倾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:05.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没错没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:08.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,然后  将滑雪板摆成内八字
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:10.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这样就不会滑得太快  不用怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:13.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,内八字
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:20.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,然后  慢慢将重心移动到前方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:21.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,重心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:27.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:29.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,再滑远一点试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:30.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:37.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就是这样  做得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.49,0:07:41.16,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  加油
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:41.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可以的可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:57.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真厉害  冬月小姐你已经会滑了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.11,0:08:01.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真了不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:02.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:08.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生状态极佳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:16.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那么  冬月小姐也会滑了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:19.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我们大家上去看看吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:22.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,上面小屋的咖喱好像很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:26.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那  我们去上面休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:32.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是脚印
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.56,0:08:34.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的诶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.25,0:08:37.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是…狐狸吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:42.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  那是我妈妈的脚印
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.03,0:08:46.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,妈妈是  毛茸茸的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:50.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家  饭做好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:55.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个  下次我能去你老家玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:09:01.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我开玩笑的  她就是个普通的阿姨啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:04.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你信了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:14.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,话说  我很好奇冰室先生的家人是什么样的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:18.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我的父母都是普通的工薪阶层
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.01,0:09:21.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原来是普通的工薪阶层
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:24.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,妹妹也是普通的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:28.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,诶  原来你有妹妹吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:29.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:33.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生有妹妹啊  我都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:37.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,虽然和冰室先生一起工作已经有一段时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:40.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,还有很多事情是我不知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.49,0:09:47.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说起来  她好像说过冬天的时候会在某个滑雪场打工
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:50.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,诶  不会是这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要真在这里我很想见见呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:55.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对吧  冬月小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.21,0:09:56.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,, 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:10:00.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,应该…不会那么巧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:05.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生的妹妹  是怎样的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:13.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我们一起吃咖喱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:15.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不错诶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:19.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:21.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,诶  哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:25.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等一下  你为什么在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:27.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:31.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真  真就有这么巧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:36.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个…这是我的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:40.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这就是冰室妹妹吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.21,0:10:43.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你们好  我叫雪泯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:47.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,现在在做读者模特和自媒体等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,读模和自媒体？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:51.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.55,0:10:53.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪泯  跟人家才第一次见面好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:56.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也有拍关于跳舞和化妆的视频
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.33,0:10:59.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,还算小有人气吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:03.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,化妆视频？  想看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:05.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是什么频道呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:11.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  不想让现实里认识的人看见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.30,0:11:15.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是「雪泯Channel」吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:18.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哇  有很多粉丝诶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:20.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:22.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:25.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这么有人气  没必要藏起来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.54,0:11:31.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个  因为  播放次数最高的视频是吃播…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.92,Koori-picture11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(690.667,223.333)}魔鬼辣大胃王挑战！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.92,Koori-picture6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(389.334,532.667)}第1名  {\c&H090706&\3c&HFFFFFF&}雪泯Channel
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.92,Koori-picture10,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\pos(386.667,628.667)\c&H0B19E8&}魔鬼辣{\c&H090706&}大胃王
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.15,0:11:33.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的诶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.55,0:11:38.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,毕竟吃播跟我计划中的路线不太相符
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:41.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我觉得很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.67,0:11:46.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,难道你就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:47.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:48.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:52.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,果然  我经常听哥哥提起…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:53.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:57.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,别闹  哥  你突然扑上来干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:11:59.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你才是  打算讲些啥啊  干活去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.47,0:12:02.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,很遗憾  我现在刚好是休息时间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:03.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,刚好？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:08.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哥不许过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:10.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,略略略
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:15.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那  那个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:17.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,听我说  冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.72,0:12:19.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我只是有点担心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:26.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪女的后裔反倒性子会很急
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:30.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哥哥在公司没有给你们添麻烦吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:33.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪女一族原来有这样的血脉特点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:36.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎么能说是麻烦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.64,0:12:41.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不如说  我一直受到冰室先生的关照
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他今天还教了我滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.19,0:12:48.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的吗  他在公司没有飘飘然吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:50.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:55.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能和冰室先生共事  是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:58.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.03,0:13:05.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她和冰室先生的瞳色一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:09.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:22.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.25,0:13:26.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,别闹啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.11,0:13:31.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,自来熟也得有个度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:34.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,放开我  哥哥什么都要管唠叨死了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.97,0:13:39.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这家伙  不会是真的看上冬月小姐了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.11,0:13:46.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.79,0:13:50.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  有什么我能帮忙的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:50.48,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,我还想赶紧再去滑雪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:51.62,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,确实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:52.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没事  交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.28,0:13:55.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  你能在公司造个滑雪场吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:56.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说不定真行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:14:01.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那么现在  章鱼烧派对正式开幕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.06,0:14:07.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,圣诞帽  也很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:11.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,为什么要在雪山上开章鱼烧派对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.11,0:14:14.94,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因为前几天我买了做章鱼烧的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.21,0:14:21.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这里的小屋也有厨具  我就说机会难得我们办一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.89,0:14:26.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我还在想冬月小姐的行李怎么那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:29.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原来是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:33.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对章鱼烧派对这么有热情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.25,0:14:37.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,绝对会很开心的  这不是很好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.09,0:14:39.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,给你  冴岛先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.47,0:14:45.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嘛  这种倒也不赖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:51.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你是不是体质原因不能吃热的东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:51.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:54.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢章鱼烧了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.84,0:14:57.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,只要是你做的什么我都吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.99,0:14:59.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.58,0:15:11.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那圣诞老人冬月  会格外给你的章鱼烧多加点料哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:18.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,圣诞老人冬月  简直就是天使
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.15,0:15:21.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,活着真好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:25.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  在室内就别搞这出了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:32.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,烤盘温度很高  大家小心烫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.21,0:15:36.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,按照步骤  安全无虞地举办章鱼烧派对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:39.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我说  在这之前我们不干个杯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:42.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:44.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,章鱼烧奉行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:44.32,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,注：奉行，日本武家时代担任行政事务的武士官名。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:46.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:26.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  酒快喝完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:29.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那我去买点回来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.80,0:16:32.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也和你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:35.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,麻烦你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:42.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说起来  喵梅洛怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.22,0:16:45.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我托付给寄养的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:48.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,它有在好好看家呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:51.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  它是个好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:11.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是…啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:15.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:19.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这个  请收下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:32.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.23,0:17:35.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因为今天是圣诞节
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:40.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是圣诞老人冰室…送的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:42.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:46.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,毛毯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:53.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我什么都没准备  你还这么费心…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.75,0:17:58.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因为我总是引起风雪  把办公室弄得很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:18:01.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一点都不冷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:05.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冰室先生在一起一直都很…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:10.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不可思议地  心里会感到温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.67,0:18:16.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:19.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,为什么冰室先生要谢我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.23,0:18:26.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊  为什么呢  忍不住就脱口而出了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:30.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我才是  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:45.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他们两个  好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.28,0:18:51.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  也挺好的啦  雪景很漂亮嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.37,0:19:00.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊  很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:32.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的吗  讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:36.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,送对方不喜欢的首饰  是最不讨好的了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:37.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:40.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,会让人觉得明明还没交往却搞这么正式
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:43.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.81,0:19:45.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我得送点感觉更轻松的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:53.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,很暖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.59,0:20:01.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个  很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.79,0:20:03.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,昨天我妹妹吵吵闹闹的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.82,0:20:05.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:08.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,小雪泯  是个很贴心的孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:13.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她问我哥哥在公司上班顺不顺利  很担心你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:14.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:22.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在小雪泯面前  你和平时表现得有些不一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:24.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.35,0:20:28.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和在公司里不一样  有种很新鲜的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:31.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,作为哥哥的冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.81,0:20:34.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,滑雪很拿手的冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:37.94,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是我的新发现
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.19,0:20:41.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能一起来滑雪真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:44.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:49.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,巴士里好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.03,0:20:51.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:02.65,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\fscx119\fscy160\fad(300,0)\pos(739.599,834.266)}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:02.65,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(768.001,687.333)}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:02.65,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(770.667,730)}------------
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:02.65,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(773.334,767.333)}有一条新信息
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.91,0:21:07.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:12.66,Koori-picture2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1386.667,445.999)}干得好!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.93,0:21:10.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,Good job
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:14.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:16.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不懂他什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,直接已读不回吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:22.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,度过了一个不错的圣诞节啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:31.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明年  要是能二人独处…就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.45,0:21:56.98,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}ふと気づけばまた視線は　追い掛けてしまう君の姿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.45,0:21:56.98,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}突然发觉之时  视线又追逐上你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:12.05,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}嫌なことがあっても心は　雨上がりの空のように
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:12.05,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}即使遇上坏事  心也如雨后初晴的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:25.36,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}君の笑顔はどうしてこんなにも　ポカポカで温かいの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:25.36,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}你的笑容为何  如此和煦温暖春风拂面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.59,0:22:33.07,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　君のこと　何でもいいからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.59,0:22:33.07,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,告诉我可以吗  只要是关于你什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:40.16,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,好きなこと　好きなもの　私にだけそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:40.16,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,只悄悄告诉我  你喜欢的事也好物也罢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.38,0:22:47.77,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　いつの日か　二人のこの距離を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.38,0:22:47.77,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,告诉我可以吗  总会有一天我们的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:58.48,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,少しずつ　少しずつ　なんて少しだけ期待してる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:58.48,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,我无比期待着  它能一点一点日渐缩短
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:06.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好  接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.73,0:23:08.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪泯Channel的下集预告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.91,0:23:12.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,竟然是  直播除夕倒计时
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:16.91,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,{\c&H353222&\3c&HF8F64C&\bord4\fs84}除夕夜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:16.91,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F64C&\3c&HF8FCB9&}雪泯Channel
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:16.91,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F64C&\3c&HECEFA7&\fs90}倒计时
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:16.91,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6032C7&\3c&H999ED2&\fs100}直播决定！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:17.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,除夕夜的雪泯Channel就决定是直播倒计时了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.29,0:23:19.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,计划了很厉害的事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.75,0:23:23.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,除夕夜就和雪泯一起倒计时吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.36,0:23:29.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那么  请点击下面的频道订阅和点赞啦
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.17,0:23:27.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\pos(948.8,842)}戳这里订阅本频道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.17,0:23:27.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\pos(948.8,842)\bord7\3c&HFFFFFF&}戳这里订阅本频道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.22,0:23:38.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这家伙  到底要做什么啊
